blocks.text:
Table yaad rakhne ka aasan tareeqa: har inverse function ka domain us ke principal function ki range hai, aur us ki range principal function ka domain. Is liye sirf chhe principal intervals yaad kijiye:
sine aur cosecant: zero ke ird gird, \(\left[-\frac{\pi}{2}, \frac{\pi}{2}\right]\) (cosecant mein 0 nikal ke);
cosine aur secant: \([0, \pi]\) (secant mein \(\frac{\pi}{2}\) nikal ke);
tangent: \(\left(-\frac{\pi}{2}, \frac{\pi}{2}\right)\); cotangent: \((0, \pi)\).
Ek aur pattern: sine, tangent, cosecant ke inverses negative jawab de sakte hain; cosine, secant, cotangent ke inverses hamesha positive (ya zero) jawab dete hain.
